        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Vere Reeve King-Fane\n- Roles: English local politician, magistrate, landowner, Vice-Chairman of Kesteven County Council, High Sheriff of Lincolnshire\n- Organizations: Kesteven County Council\n- Places: Lincolnshire\n- Topics: High Sheriff of Lincolnshire\n\nFacts:\n- William Vere Reeve King-Fane was born on 29 October 1868 and died on 5 November 1943.\n- William Vere Reeve King-Fane was an English local politician, magistrate, and landowner.\n- William Vere Reeve King-Fane served as Vice-Chairman of Kesteven County Council.\n- William Vere Reeve King-Fane served as High Sheriff of Lincolnshire.\n- The High Sheriff of Lincolnshire changes every March.",
